      "near_leg",
      "skirt"
    ],
    "reason": "The knee needs the consumer's -88 degree relative motion. The ankle only reaches +21 degrees, while the separate white-stocking/boot seam and ambiguous foot-slot pivot create more visible risk than motion value. The merged lower piece should sit behind the thigh so its hidden knee tab is actually covered; this reverses the current fixed thigh-before-lower assumption for this far-leg group."
